Aman dalam berkendara — Bertanggung jawab — Disiplin — Jujur — Menguasai rute — Siap bekerja mobile", "content2": "<h2>LOWONGAN KERJA</h2><h2>DRIVER OPERASIONAL</h2><p><strong>PT. Danatel Pratama</strong><br>📍 Jakarta</p><p>PT. Danatel Pratama sedang membuka kesempatan untuk bergabung sebagai <strong>Driver Operasional</strong>.</p><p>Kami mencari kandidat yang <strong>berpengalaman, bertanggung jawab, memahami area Jakarta dan sekitarnya</strong>, serta mampu menjaga kendaraan dan barang yang dibawa.</p><h2>Tanggung Jawab</h2><ul><li><p>Mengemudikan kendaraan operasional perusahaan dengan aman dan bertanggung jawab.</p></li><li><p>Mengantar dan mengambil barang sesuai kebutuhan perusahaan/project.</p></li><li><p>Membantu proses loading dan unloading barang apabila diperlukan.</p></li><li><p>Memastikan barang yang dibawa dalam kondisi aman sampai tujuan.</p></li><li><p>Melakukan pengecekan kondisi kendaraan sebelum dan setelah digunakan.</p></li><li><p>Menjaga kebersihan dan kondisi kendaraan.</p></li><li><p>Melakukan koordinasi dengan tim terkait jadwal pengiriman dan pengambilan barang.</p></li><li><p>Mematuhi peraturan lalu lintas dan prosedur keselamatan perusahaan.</p></li><li><p>Membantu kebutuhan operasional perusahaan lainnya yang berkaitan dengan tugas driver.</p></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>Usia <strong>maksimal 45 tahun</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Pendidikan minimal <strong>SMA/SMK atau sederajat</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Memiliki <strong>SIM B1 yang masih aktif</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Memiliki pengalaman sebagai driver operasional minimal <strong>2 tahun</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Berpengalaman mengemudikan truk engkel menjadi nilai lebih / lebih disukai.</strong></p></li><li><p>Memahami dan menguasai area <strong>Jakarta dan sekitarnya</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Memahami penggunaan Google Maps/Waze.</p></li><li><p>Sehat jasmani dan mampu bekerja secara mobile.</p></li><li><p>Memiliki sikap disiplin, jujur, bertanggung jawab, dan memiliki etika kerja yang baik.</p></li><li><p>Bersedia bekerja dengan jam kerja operasional dan kebutuhan perjalanan perusahaan.</p></li><li><p>Tidak memiliki catatan pelanggaran lalu lintas yang serius.</p></li></ul><h2>Preferred</h2><p>⭐ Berpengalaman mengemudikan <strong>truk engkel</strong><br>⭐ Berpengalaman membawa barang/project equipment<br>⭐ Familiar dengan area Jabodetabek<br>⭐ Terbiasa melakukan delivery ke kantor, warehouse, site, dan project<br>⭐ Memahami perawatan dasar kendaraan</p><p><br></p>", "status": "Active", "isExpired": false, "isLinkOut": false, "isVerified": true, "expiresAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-09-18T13:59:59.999Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "listedAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-19T06:27:38.039Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "salary": null, "workTypes": {"label": "Kontrak/Temporer", "__typename": "JobWorkTypes"}, "advertiser": {"id": "63351316", "name": "PT. Danatel Pratama", "isVerified": true, "registrationDate": {"dateTimeUtc": "2025-10-28T02:47:39.901Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "__typename": "Advertiser"}, "location": {"label": "Jakarta Selatan, Jakarta Raya", "__typename": "LocationInfo"}, "classifications": [{"label": "Transportasi Jalan (Manufaktur, Transportasi & Logistik)", "__typename": "ClassificationInfo"}], "products": {"bullets": null, "branding": null, "questionnaire": {"questions": ["Pernyataan mana di bawah ini yang paling mendeskripsikan hakmu bekerja di Indonesia?", "Berapa gaji bulanan yang kamu inginkan?", "Kualifikasi mana yang kamu miliki?", "Do you have Logistics Coordination experience?", "Berapa tahun pengalaman kerjamu sebagai Supervisor Operasional?", "Apakah kamu memiliki pengalaman Pemeriksaan Kendaraan?", "Berapa tahun pengalaman kerjamu sebagai Driver Operasional?"], "__typename": "JobQuestionnaire"}, "video": null, "__typename": "JobProducts"}, "__typename": "Job"}, "workArrangements": {"arrangements": [{"type": "ONSITE", "label": "Kantor", "__typename": "JobDetailsWorkArrangement"}], "label": "", "__typename": "JobDetailsWorkArrangements"}, "seoInfo": {"normalisedRoleTitle": "Driver", "workType": "244", "classification": ["6092"], "subClassification": ["6111"], "where": "South Jakarta Jakarta", "broaderLocationName": "Jakarta Selatan", "normalisedOrganisationName": "Danatel Pratama", "__typename": "SEOInfo"}, "companyProfile": {"id": "168556109349879", "name": "Danatel Pratama", "companyNameSlug": "danatel-pratama-168556109349879", "shouldDisplayReviews": true, "branding": null, "overview": {"description": {"paragraphs": ["PENGUMUMAN :", "PT Danatel Pratama tidak pernah memungut biaya apapun dalam proses rekrutmen.", "PT Danatel Pratama tidak pernah bekerja sama dengan travel agent / biro perjalanan tertentu dalam proses rekrutmen.", "Apabila Anda diminta untuk membayar sejumlah uang dalam bentuk pembayaran tiket pesawat dan hotel atau akomodasi lainnya agar diabaikan.", "Jangan memberikan data pribadi atau data keuangan Anda kepada siapapun.", "Jika membutuhkan klarifikasi lebih lanjut dapat langsung menghubungi PT Danatel Pratama", "PT Danatel Pratama established on December 17, 1991, with the initial name PT Pakar Graha, and then transformed into PT Danatel Pratama on June 11, 1992. Start business as a first distributor from Philips Communication, Security & Imaging for Indonesian area with a CCTV as a main product. After Philips CSI purchased by BOSCH, we became a distributor for BOSCH security system products on 1997. As well as being the sole distributor for the ESSER brand fire alarm products from Honeywell.", "In its journey PT sup Danatel Pratama become not only as distributor but provide several services like design security system, installation, contractor, and maintenance. Now we have been cooperating with various distributors security system, so that we can provide a diversity of product to customers, and adjust to the needs of consumers. In the future PT Danatel Pratama wants to be total solution provider for security system with quality products and top class after salesport.", "Our Motto :", "1. Quality", "Supply our customers with quality products and qualified personnel.", "2. Trust", "Do our job proffesionally, responsive technical support, and competitive price.", "Commitment :", "We believed that long term and good relation with customer is key factor to achieve success.", "Customer satisfaction is our first priority. Every personnel in company is well trained in their field and committed in providing only the best service to you.", "What is customer’s needs is our consideration in giving service to customers.", "That’s why we always offering innovation, idea and solution base on cost effectiveness."], "__typename": "Description"}, "industry": "Chemicals & Plastics Manufacturing", "size": {"description": "51-100 employees", "__typename": "CompanySize"}, "website": null, "__typename": "Overview"}, "reviewsSummary": {"overallRating": {"numberOfReviews": {"value": 7, "__typename": "NumberOfReviews"}, "value": 4.1, "__typename": "OverallRating"}, "__typename": "ReviewsSummary"}, "perksAndBenefits": [{"title": "Medical", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}, {"title": "Miscellaneous allowance", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}, {"title": "Vision", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}], "__typename": "CompanyProfile"}, "companySearchUrl": "https://id.jobstreet.com/id/Danatel-Pratama-jobs/at-this-company", "companyTags": [], "__typename": "JobDetails"}}

